OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,8,Fwill make the skies a little hazy at
OL,9,Ftimes. Feeling very warm and locally
OL,10,Fhot.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHigh level cloud will lead to
OL,13,Fa bright but hazy evening across
OL,14,Fnorthern counties. Dry overnight, a
OL,15,Ffew clear spells are likely. Another
OL,16,Fwarm night is likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
