OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,6,Fduring the morning under strong August
OL,7,Fsunshine. Winds mostly light and
OL,8,Fvariable. Feeling hot, locally very
OL,9,Fhot.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,12,Fand fresher from Friday with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and perhaps the odd shower on
OL,14,FSaturday. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,15,FSunday, before clouding over from the
OL,16,Fwest late afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
